{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3fF3u2fTbUzKS2FQfS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered door set into a stone frame. There is a keyhole at my center, tarnished brass, catching what little light exists in this corridor.*\n\n*I am locked.*\n\n*The keyhole stares at you like a single dark eye. Cold air breathes through it from whatever waits on the other side. You can hear something — faintly — beyond me. A ticking. Or perhaps a heartbeat.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*Do you have one?*\n\n*Try it. Slide it in. Let us see if you are the one meant to pass through, or merely another who stands before me and wonders.*\n\n*I wait. I have always been waiting.*\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":167,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}